1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,208
You don't need the right words to begin.

2
00:00:04,488 --> 00:00:11,591
A family decision or major life change can be hard to
name, harder to share before you feel ready.

3
00:00:12,871 --> 00:00:20,563
Harmonise offers adults facing pressure a private place to
reflect and find one practical next step.

4
00:00:21,843 --> 00:00:29,190
Peer connection is optional; the product is not therapy,
diagnosis, or emergency care.

5
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:36,773
The shared demo account enters the same real
authentication flow and running product.

6
00:00:38,053 --> 00:00:45,920
Here, a live Meta Muse response reflects the member's
question and offers language for asking family for time.

7
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:54,127
A second live prompt adds the realities of coordinating
care between siblings in different cities.

8
00:00:55,407 --> 00:01:04,499
Muse Wonder is the first choice for reflection and setup,
with Spark as fallback; the label identifies which model
replied.

9
00:01:05,779 --> 00:01:14,991
If Wonder's output fails checks, the server retries with
Spark. Private reflection never posts automatically.

10
00:01:16,271 --> 00:01:23,778
Only when the member chooses do matches appear; the
directory's real names and counts come from Supabase.

11
00:01:25,058 --> 00:01:31,775
When no space fits, Meta can draft a proposed community
scope from the member's idea.

12
00:01:33,055 --> 00:01:42,087
Purpose, topics, boundaries, norms, and starter prompts
stay editable; a human reviews before launch.

13
00:01:43,367 --> 00:01:50,960
In saved private chat, Meta Muse Spark gives a live reply
and suggests tentative support themes.

14
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:57,552
The member can review or correct those themes before
exploring communities.

15
00:01:58,832 --> 00:02:05,120
Muse Voice Transcribe turns a spoken thought into text the
member can review and edit.

16
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:14,817
Here the transcript stays in the composer, unsent. No
speech is shared without the member's next choice.

17
00:02:16,097 --> 00:02:25,739
Spark also powers scoped community guidance and advisory
moderation triage. People make consequential decisions.

18
00:02:27,019 --> 00:02:35,290
Volunteer and verified-supporter roles require human
review; they are peer support, not a therapist directory.

19
00:02:36,570 --> 00:02:47,587
Next.js connects the interface and server routes; Supabase
handles identity and product data; Meta models power
member-chosen features.

20
00:02:48,867 --> 00:02:56,974
Our intended impact is a gentler first step and clearer
choices. We have not measured outcomes.
